  "title": "Listen & write",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Some verbs change their **vowel** between persons. The আমি form has **u** or **i**; the other forms have **o** or **e**:\n\n- শোনা 'listen': আমি **শুনি** — সে **শোনে**\n- লেখা 'write': আমি **লিখি** — সে **লেখে**\n- ওঠা 'get up': আমি **উঠি** — আপনি **ওঠেন** (Lesson 2)\n\nCompare **দেখা** from the last lesson, which never changes: আমি **দেখি**, সে **দেখে**. So learn each verb as an আমি + সে pair.\n\n**গান** is 'song', and **গান শোনা** is how you say 'listen to music': **আমি গান শুনি**.\n\n**সাধারণত** (*shadharonoto*) 'usually' goes early in the sentence: **আমি সাধারণত রাতে গান শুনি** 'I usually listen to music at night'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "shuni",
      "bn": "শুনি",
      "tr": "shuni",
      "en": "I listen"
    },
    {
      "id": "shone",
